<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01 · 袭击、反击、对峙与镇压 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Setting upon, Standing up to & Clamping down</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>27 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>从上方猛扑向目标即袭击（set upon / lay into），挺直身躯不低头即勇敢对抗（stand up to），从上方施加铁腕重压即镇压（clamp/crack down on）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>hold <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>6/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: defy)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>resist or confront with resistance</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>defy, withstand</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The politician defied public opinion.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The new material withstands even the greatest wear and tear.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>The bridge held.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>face <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [confront] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>deal with (something unpleasant) head on</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>confront, face</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>You must confront your problems.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>He faced the terrible consequences of his mistakes.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>stand <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 6 个核心义项'>2/6</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [resist] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>refuse to back down; remain solid under criticism or attack</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>resist, withstand</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>stand</b> <b>up</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
