<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>lay <span class='pt-highlight'>in</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>keep or lay aside for future use</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>store</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Store grain for the winter.</div></div>
