<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04 · 强迫、限制、驱逐与消灭 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Forcing into, Hemming in & Wiping out</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>50 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>四周筑墙包围即限制（hem/box in），连根拔出并彻底擦除即根除消灭（root/wipe out）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 12 个核心义项'>6/12</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [eject] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>put out or expel from a place</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>eject, exclude</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The unruly student was excluded from the game.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>do <span class='pt-highlight'>away with</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [extinguish] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>terminate, end, or take out</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>extinguish, eliminate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Let's eliminate the course on Akkadian hieroglyphics.</div></div>
