<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Eliminate my debts.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>apart</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [disassemble] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>take apart into its constituent pieces</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>disassemble, dismantle</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>They decided to <b>take</b> it <b>apart</b> right away.</div></div></div></td></tr>
